option.BLOCKS_PER_DOUBLING=Blocks per 2x zoom
comment.BLOCKS_PER_DOUBLING=Smaller values make upward flight or downward void-fall zoom faster.
option.VOID_TWIST_PERIOD=Void spiral distance
