option.MAX_ITERATIONS=Maximum iterations
comment.MAX_ITERATIONS=Higher values reveal finer edges but cost more GPU time.
option.MAX_ZOOM_STEPS=Maximum zoom steps
comment.MAX_ZOOM_STEPS=Maximum base-2 zoom exponent. The reference-orbit mod supports up to 96; fallback mode safely caps itself at 17.
option.FRACTAL_OPACITY=Sky opacity
comment.FRACTAL_OPACITY=How strongly the Mandelbrot colors replace the vanilla sky.
